cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you would like to cite this repository, the format below is suggested.
  The substance of each dispatch belongs to its issuing public authority;
  this citation covers only the English translation and regional curation.
  Suggested short form: "China Travel Intel by YouTu Travel".
title: "China Travel Intel"
abstract: >-
  Verified China travel intelligence for international visitors, maintained by
  YouTu Travel: visa-free and 144-hour transit policy updates, high-speed rail
  corridor changes, 5A scenic area and World Heritage capacity alerts, and
  primary official dispatches translated and cross-verified into English.
type: dataset
authors:
